B.c5b=new A.fj(B.d9,"Resilient Multi-Key Receipt Retrieval","Multi-field indexing ensures every student fee receipt is immediately visible in student and admin histories across student IDs, auth UIDs, and mobile numbers.","Receipts","receipt_long","/admin/receipts","View Receipts")
B.c5c=new A.fj(B.p4,"Instant QR Scan Expiration Verification","Scanning a student QR instantly displays valid, grace, or expired states with instant action to record renewal payments directly from the check-in sheet.","Admin Scanner","qr_code","/admin/qr-scanner","Open Scanner")
B.c5d=new A.fj(B.hV,"Direct Owner, Admin & Manager Helplines","Access separate direct contact numbers for the Library Owner, Admin, and Manager with instant Call and WhatsApp buttons directly from your profile and dashboard.","Direct Contacts","support_agent","/student/profile","View Contacts")
B.c5e=new A.fj(B.eW,"Categorized Quick Action Studio & Instant Petty Cash Logging","Upgraded the bottom (+) button into a high-speed Quick Action Studio grouped into Daily Transactions and Admissions/Notices. Added 5-second petty cash expense logging directly updating the Net Facility Profit.","Quick Action Studio","bolt","/admin/home","Try Studio (+)")
B.c5f=new A.fj(B.fH,"Multi-Notice Carousel & Dedicated Notice Board","Browse library announcements in a swipeable dashboard carousel with instant dismiss and view full historical circulars in the new Notice Board & Circulars hub.","Notice Board","campaign","/student/announcements","View Notices")
B.c5g=new A.fj(B.v8,"48-Hour Atomic Plan Reversion & Receipt Voiding","Accidentally changed a student plan? Instantly revert back to the previous plan, restore validity dates, void generated receipts, and retract wallet balances with a single tap within 48 hours.","1-Click Undo","approval","/admin/students","Student Directory")
B.c5h=new A.fj(B.jK,"Library Logo & 3D Security Seal","Your digital pass now displays the official organization logo and authentic background watermark for verification.","Official Pass","account_balance",null,null)
