B.c5k=new A.fj(B.p4,"Fast Pass Verification & Desk Allocation Status","Scanning student passes instantly verifies membership validity, desk allocation, and fee status with 1-tap renewal action directly at the front desk.","QR Scanner","qr_code","/admin/qr-scanner","Open Scanner")
B.c5l=new A.fj(B.mc,"Semantic Notification Deduplication & Self-Healing Purge","Eliminated duplicate alerts across student and admin notification hubs with semantic deduplication, 60-minute idempotency write-guards, and background orphan cleanup.","Zero-Duplication","notifications_active","/admin/home","Open Dashboard")
B.c5m=new A.fj(B.p1,"Historical Bulk Admission Date Customization & Cycle Alignment","Easily backdate student joining dates during bulk CSV import or 1-tap adjust dates in student profiles. Subscriptions automatically align with month-end or exact 30-day cycles with full audit trail.","Bulk Admissions & Dates","history_edu","/admin/students","Student Directory")
B.c5n=new A.fj(B.j4,"Live Anti-Fraud Status & Real-Time QR Check-In","Your digital student pass automatically updates to Active, Grace Period, or Expired with instant entry verification at the front desk.","Digital Pass","qr_code","/student/home","View Digital Pass")
B.c5o=new A.fj(B.l9,"Guaranteed Seat Hold & 1-Tap Renewal Flow","Never lose your favorite desk. Active students get an exclusive seat reservation hold badge and a streamlined 1-tap renewal flow to lock in their seat effortlessly.","Seat Protection","lock","/student/renew","Review Renewals")
B.c5p=new A.fj(B.va,"Anti-Fraud UTR Replay Defense & AC Power Surcharge","Automated bank/UPI UTR duplicate detection across payments preventing screenshot reuse, dedicated high-wattage power amenity toggle, and dynamic custom field regex validation.","Anti-Fraud & Ledger","shield","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
